{title: Oliyile Therivadhu Devadhaya}
{artist: Karthik Azhagi Ilaiyaraaja}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] Oliyilae Therivadhu [Em] Dhaevadhaiyaa,        [Am] Uyirilae Kalandhadhu [Em] Neeyillaiyaa
Idhu [Am] Nesamaa Nesamillai [E] yaa,        [Am] Nenavukku Theriyali [E] yaa
[Am] Kanavilae Nadakkudhaa,        [C] Kangalum [E] Kaangiradhaa [Am] Kaangiradhaa
[Am] Chinna Manasukku Velangavillayae,        [Dm] Nadappadhu [C] Ennennu.... [Am] ..
[Am] Enna Enniyum Puriyavillayae,        [Dm] Nadandhadhu [C] Ennennu.... [Am] ..
[Am] Koyil Maniya [Dm] Yaaru Atikkura [E] aaa,        [Am] Thoongaa Velakka [Dm] Yaaru Yaethura [E] aaa
[Am] Oru Poadhum Anaiyaama [Em] Endrum Oliranum
